   "id": "542e2d5c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Your Answer:**\n",
    "\n",
    "| | |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| **(i) What it looks like** | The generator and discriminator losses fluctuate wildly, and image quality keeps changing without improving. |\n",
    "| **(ii) Root cause** | The generator and discriminator are competing networks, making optimization unstable. |\n",
    "| **(iii) Mitigation** | Use Batch Normalization, careful learning-rate tuning, or architectures like DCGAN/WGAN-GP for more stable training. |\n",
